@prefix is: <http://infiniq.co.kr/2026/industry_safety#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

is:안전검사대상기계 a owl:Class .
is:안전검사 a owl:Class .
is:안전검사결과 a owl:Class .

is:필요하다 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:안전검사대상기계 ;
    rdfs:range is:안전검사 .
is:has결과 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:안전검사 ;
    rdfs:range is:안전검사결과 .

is:has주기 a owl:DataProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:안전검사 ;
    rdfs:range xsd:duration .
is:has합격여부 a owl:DataProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:안전검사결과 ;
    rdfs:range xsd:boolean .
is:has최근검사일 a owl:DataProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:안전검사결과 ;
    rdfs:range xsd:date .







